    "summary": "Added the job kind { kind: 'subsystems'; repoPath } to the IndexJob union. Both isSummaryJob predicates (src/daemon/queue.ts and src/daemon/threads/summary-link.ts) route it to the summary lane, which starts only while the index lane is idle and hands its jobs to the summary worker. A queued job per repository is deduped. IndexerService.processJob runs it through a protected subsystemPass(repoPath), which calls runSubsystemPass; it's a seam so tests run no model. enqueueSubsystemsIfComplete queues it at the end of a full index, a settle (runSettlePass) and a clean-up (resolveAfterReconcile) when readIndexState(repo).graphComplete is true. The queue-lanes test's label switch learned the new kind.",
